   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "MENU DE ALTERNATIVAS - copia y pega\n\nCAJA 2 - CAPA\n- deep crimson wool cloak billowing violently in the wind\n- torn black wool cloak whipping in the wind\n- deep royal blue cloak with gold embroidered border\n- bleached white linen cloak stained with dust and blood\n- dark green cloak heavy with rain\n\nCAJA 3 - ARMA Y ESCUDO\n- battle-worn bronze hoplon shield and long ash spear\n- large round bronze shield painted with a lambda symbol and a short xiphos sword\n- cracked wooden shield and a heavy iron mace\n- tall tower shield and a long pike\n\nCAJA 5 - CIELO Y CLIMA (solo el cielo)\n- heavy grey rain\n- black storm clouds breaking apart\n- clear night sky full of stars\n- thick fog swallowing the valley\n- burning orange sunset clouds\n\nCAJA 6 - LUZ Y ATMOSFERA (solo la luz)\n- wet bronze reflecting a dull sky, lightning on the horizon\n- dramatic golden backlight from the rising sun behind his silhouette, volumetric god rays cutting through haze\n- cold blue moonlight, thin mist rolling over the rocks\n- swirling dust and glowing embers in the air, firelight from below\n- harsh overhead sun, sharp black shadows\n\nTRUCO: mezcla libremente. \"black storm clouds breaking\napart\" (caja 5) + \"dramatic golden backlight ... god\nrays\" (caja 6) da el rayo de sol atravesando la\ntormenta. Eso antes no se podia.\n\nCAJA 7 - COLOR Y OPTICA\n- teal and orange color grading, high contrast chiaroscuro lighting, anamorphic lens flare, shallow depth of field, 35mm anamorphic film, heavy film grain\n- desaturated bleach bypass look, muted greens and greys, harsh contrast, 16mm film grain\n- warm golden sepia tones, soft glowing highlights, vintage lens bloom\n- cold steel blue monochrome, minimal color, high contrast"
   ],
   "title": "MENU DE ALTERNATIVAS",
   "color": "#233",
   "bgcolor": "#355"
  },
